Homepage: https://rustbb.github.io
Description: lightweight bulletin board in one executable
 RustBB is a forum: categories, topics and posts in Markdown, sign-in with
 Telegram, OpenID Connect, GitHub or passkeys, moderation, search, feeds
 and bot notifications, in one static binary with an SQLite database.
 .
 This package installs it as a systemd service, rustbb, which runs as a
 dynamic user with its database in /var/lib/rustbb. It is not started:
 set up the forum in /etc/rustbb/env, then systemctl enable --now rustbb.
 A web server in front, such as Xenia (xenia-server), serves it over HTTPS.

